            "readonly": true,
            "desc": "Whether the last check found the feed quiet.\nThis is the flag as of the last sweep. A consumer that can read `rounds_since_update` should also do that arithmetic itself; the flag's value is that it is recorded on-chain by someone with no stake in hiding it, and that it emits an event a monitor can alert on.",
